# {{PLUGIN_NAME}} — opencode installation

{{PLUGIN_NAME}} is loaded as a local opencode plugin from `.opencode/plugins/`.

## Install

1. Copy this plugin directory into your project (opencode picks up
   `.opencode/plugins/` automatically).
2. Restart opencode so it rescans plugin directories.

## Skill discovery

Skills live in **one source**: the plugin-root `skills/` directory. `opencode.json`
declares `"skills": ["./skills/"]`, so opencode reads them straight from that
single source — no per-harness copies are needed. If you install the plugin
globally, copy `skills/` into `~/.config/opencode/skills/<plugin>/` instead.

## Use

Ask the agent to run one of this plugin's skills (see `skills/`).
